    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but can u go a bit deeper for me? specifically on the \"liberal\" side—i want to make sure i don't oversimplify it. like, what are the actual theological or philosophical justifications they use to connect things like autonomy and compassion back to their faith? it feels like a lot of the scholarship focuses on the secular rights aspect, so i'm looking for the more nuanced religious reasoning.",
